Third-party packages
--------------------

Built decks contain parts of other open source packages. Each package carries its own license text
in node_modules and in the built output. The ones that need a word here:

- Icon sets @iconify-json/carbon and @iconify-json/mdi (Apache-2.0) and @iconify-json/ph (MIT): icons are inlined into built decks.
- elkjs (EPL-2.0, through Mermaid): bundled into decks that use diagrams.
- dompurify (MPL-2.0 OR Apache-2.0, used here under Apache-2.0) and jszip (MIT OR GPL-3.0-or-later, used here under MIT).
- lightningcss (MPL-2.0) and caniuse-lite (CC-BY-4.0) are build tools; they are not part of the output.
- Monaco Editor (MIT) with its codicon font (CC-BY-4.0), KaTeX (MIT) with its fonts (OFL-1.1), Shiki, Mermaid, UnoCSS,
  drauu and rough-notation (MIT).

